{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-steam-cleaner-yx-602-2608-0174","content_id":"4c3af659-c488-4e60-94a0-c0904dcd59b0","description":"Product Safety Report for Steam Cleaner presenting a serious risk of fire and electric shock.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"cabeb3f7-1cb5-4bac-921c-b03d03b550db","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-09-08T14:06:19+01:00","id":"cabeb3f7-1cb5-4bac-921c-b03d03b550db","title":"Link to Product Image and PDF","updated_at":"2026-09-08T14:06:19+01:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6aa0084b5f6e942efe37eeef/2608-0174-product-safety-report-steam-cleaner.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Steam Cleaner, YX-602</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a serious risk of fire as it is inadequately earthed.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The import has been rejected at the border.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Electrical appliances and equipment - Steam Cleaners</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Model</td>\n      <td>YX-602</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Carton Identifiers</td>\n      <td>1154563, OCC087652350017</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>China</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>A steam cleaner with attached power cord and wall plug. The product also comes with additional nozzles as accessories.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_cabeb3f7-1cb5-4bac-921c-b03d03b550db\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6aa0084b5f6e942efe37eeef/2608-0174-product-safety-report-steam-cleaner.pdf\">Link to Product Image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product presents a serious risk of fire as the plug fuse has insufficient granular filler and therefore does not meet the requirements of BS 1362. A compliant, correctly rated fuse is required to ensure the safe operation of the product under fault conditions. Should a fault occur, without granular filler the plug may overheat and ignite, causing a fire. The product also presents a risk of electric shock as accessible metal parts can become live during use.</p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the Electrical Equipment (Safety) Regulations 2016 or the Plugs &amp; Sockets etc. (Safety) Regulations 1994.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The import has been rejected at the border and destroyed.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2608-0174, 2608-0189</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-08-21T08:57:27Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-safety-report","product_category":"electrical-appliances-equipment","product_measure_type":["destruction-of-the-product","import-rejected-at-border"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-08-21","product_risk_level":"serious"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2026-08-21T09:57:27+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-steam-cleaner-yx-602-2608-0174","api_url":"https://